  "*** Light is destroyed by zombies, and the world will be shrouded in shadow ***": {
    "translation": "光明被僵尸摧毁,整个世界将笼罩在暗影之中"
  },
  "*** It's now. Defeat shadow !!!!! ***": {
    "translation": "就是现在!击败暗影!!!!!"
  },
  "*** Don't let zombies get the power of light. Hold here ***": {
    "translation": "不要让僵尸夺取光明之力,守住这里!"
  },
  "*** Time has been reset, but we have found another way to the temple of light. We need to go ahead of the core ***": {
    "translation": "时间已被重置,但我们找到了通往光之神殿的另一条路,必须抢在核心前面!"
  },
  "*** We need the power of light here to defeat the shadow ***": {
    "translation": "我们需要借助这里的光明之力来击败暗影"
  },
  "*** zombie is coming,retreat ***": {
    "translation": "僵尸正在逼近,快撤退!"
  },
  "*** Zombies are faster than us. We lose ***": {
    "translation": "僵尸比我们更快,我们失败了!"
  },
  "*** Something's wrong ***": {
    "translation": "情况有些不对劲..."
  },
  "*** Core perceives us ,it will use the power of light to defeat us ***": {
    "translation": "核心察觉到了我们,它将利用光明之力来击败我们!"
  },
  "*** Now zombies are coming faster ***": {
    "translation": "现在僵尸正在以更快的速度逼近!"
  },
  "*** Shadow ruled the world a long time ago ***": {
    "translation": "很久以前,暗影统治着整个世界"
  },
  "*** Light has been gone for a long time ***": {
    "translation": "光明早已消失了许久"
  },
  "*** People only respect the light ***": {
    "translation": "人们只崇尚光明"
  },
  "*** Shadow disguises light ***": {
    "translation": "暗影伪装成了光明"
  },
  "*** Camouflage weakens shadow ***": {
    "translation": "伪装使暗影变得虚弱"
  },
  "*** Maybe one day, shadow will be really defeated ***": {
    "translation": "或许终有一天,暗影会被彻底击败"
  },
  "*** Zombies have escaped. You've lost ***": {
    "translation": "僵尸已经逃脱,你们失败了!"
  },
  "*** This is the temple of light, but it has been occupied by the core ***": {
    "translation": "这里是光之神殿,但它已被核心占据"
  },
  "*** No one escapes success, the shadow covers the world ***": {
    "translation": "无人成功逃脱,暗影笼罩了整个世界"
  },
  "*** Press both squares at the same time ***": {
    "translation": "同时按下两个方块"
  },
  "*** Touch the light block to destroy the core ***": {
    "translation": "找到前往核心的方法..."
  },
  "*** Protected by light, you are now immune to zombie attacks, but zombies will still prevent you from escaping ***": {
    "translation": "在光明的庇护下,你们现在免疫僵尸的攻击,但僵尸仍会阻止你们逃脱!"
  },
  "*** It's too late for you to escape ***": {
    "translation": "已经太迟了,你们无法逃脱!"
  },
  "*** you did it !!! Core have been defeated by you,but you still have to resist zombie attacks until the end ***": {
    "translation": "你们成功了!!!核心已被击败,但仍需抵御僵尸的进攻,坚守到最后!"
  },
  "*** Zombie freeze is stronger ***": {
    "translation": "僵尸的冰冻能力增强了!"
  },
  "*** You escaped, but the core became shadow ***": {
    "translation": "你们成功逃脱了,但核心已经化为了暗影"
  },
  "*** The ring protects core and restarts the time ***": {
    "translation": "光环正在保护核心,并重新启动时间循环"
  },
  "*** Now you're facing real shadow ***": {
    "translation": "现在,你们面对的才是真正的暗影!"
  },
  "*** Zombies are faster than you. You lose ***": {
    "translation": "僵尸比你们更快,你们失败了!"
  },
  "*** Beat it! False light ! ***": {
    "translation": "击败它!虚伪之光!"
  },
  "*** The core run away,But we found another way ***": {
    "translation": "核心逃走了,但我们找到了另一条路"
  },
  "*** Core has noticed us ***": {
    "translation": "核心已经察觉到了我们"
  },
  "*** Ring has noticed us ***": {
    "translation": "光环已经察觉到了我们"
  },
  "*** Shadow is too strong ***": {
    "translation": "暗影的力量太强大了"
  },
  "*** Light is here ! Ring is restoring power to Light !!! ***": {
    "translation": "光明降临了!光环正在为光明恢复力量!!!"
  },
  "*** Light is protecting us. We must protect Light until the last moment !!! ***": {
    "translation": "光明正在庇护我们!我们必须保护光明,坚守到最后一刻!!!"
  },
  "*** Charging:0% ***": {
    "translation": "充能进度:百分之0"
  },
