  },
  "*** Charging:80% ***": {
    "translation": "充能进度:百分之80"
  },
  "*** Charging:90% ***": {
    "translation": "充能进度:百分之90"
  },
  "*** Charging:100% ***": {
    "translation": "充能进度:百分之100"
  },
  "*** We need to go back to the place where Ring was born. Maybe we can find a way to defeat shadow ***": {
    "translation": "我们必须返回光环诞生的地方,或许能在那里找到击败暗影的方法"
  },
  "*** It's too late. Zombies come out ***": {
    "translation": "已经太迟了,僵尸逃脱了!"
  },
  "*** A long time ago, Shadow drown out Light ***": {
    "translation": "很久以前,暗影吞噬了光明"
  },
  "*** Shadow steal the power of Light ***": {
    "translation": "暗影窃取了光明的力量"
  },
  "*** Ring is deceived by the power of Light ***": {
    "translation": "光环受到了光明之力的蒙骗"
  },
  "*** Ring has served false Light for a long time ***": {
    "translation": "光环已经为虚假的光明效力了很长时间"
  },
  "*** One day, Ring and Shadow were awakened ***": {
    "translation": "直到有一天,光环与暗影被唤醒了"
  },
  "*** These people found false Light and destroyed it on the way to escape ***": {
    "translation": "这些人在逃亡途中发现了虚假的光明,并将其摧毁"
  },
  "*** Ring resets the time, and people finally have the chance to defeat Shadow ***": {
    "translation": "光环重置了时间,人们终于获得了击败暗影的机会"
  },
  "*** With the help of Light, people overcome Shadow, and the world reappears light ***": {
    "translation": "在光明的帮助下,人们战胜了暗影,世界终于重见光明"
  },
  "*** Zombies get the power of light. You lose ***": {
    "translation": "僵尸获得了光明之力,你们失败了!"
  }
}
